| KEGG | hsa00020 | Citrate cycle (TCA cycle) | DOWN | Parallels the shut‑down of aerobic metabolism |
| KEGG | hsa00071 | Fatty acid degradation | DOWN | Shift away from fatty acid oxidation is a classic feature of the ischemic heart |
